#X msg 25 410 \; car-tyre-db 0 \; car-mic-h 1.5 \; car-ground 0.9 \; car-soft 1 \; car-c0 3 \; car-revs 1;
#X text 330 50 Tyre noise equals the engine in dB(A) at 45 km/h and rises 30 dB per decade of speed. The offset moves it up or down (rough road + \, quiet road -)., f 36;
#X text 330 175 The road reflects sound to the microphone (Doppler and comb filter). Grass between road and microphone absorbs mid frequencies (ISO 9613-2). Weather: average loss from wind and temperature \, grows with distance (ISO 9613-2)., f 36;
#X text 330 335 Revs come from the speed through 5 gears. 1.5 = a lower gear., f 36;
#X text 330 410 <- click to reset these defaults, f 36;
